services/ml/user_history.json
**/user_history.json

# Test output
**/coverage/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
